          "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 115\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"40\" y=\"35\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">2/3 擴分成分母 12：</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"50\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#0f172a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"50\" width=\"240\" height=\"26\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.28)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#0f172a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#0f172a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#2563eb\">每大格分 4 小格，2 大格 ＝ 2 × 4 ＝ 8 小格 (8/12)</text></svg>",
